&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks is experiencing tremendous growth as enterprise organizations transition from evaluating AI to rapidly deploying production-grade AI systems. This role exists to redefine how we enable our largest customers to move faster, activate their data workforces, and convert platform investments into measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Manager of Capability Engineering &amp;amp; AI Adoption for EMEA, you will lead two complementary teams: a regional group of Customer Enablement Architects who act as trusted advisors and builder-enablement partners for Databricks’ largest, most complex accounts, and the EMEA Scaled User Programmes team, whose mission is to design and execute broad, high-impact enablement initiatives across the region. Operating at the intersection of technical depth, program strategy, and business outcomes, you will translate advanced product roadmaps into both personalized, just-in-time capability programs and scalable enablement engines that meet customers wherever they are in their modernization and AI adoption journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You Will Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead, coach, and develop an elite regional team of Customer Enablement Architects across EMEA, setting a high standard for technical depth, customer impact, and creative problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capability Engineering at Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Redesign enterprise enablement workflows, moving away from legacy episodic models to continuous, contextual, and hyper-personalized capability building aligned with customers&#39; modernization curves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Adoption &amp;amp; MAU Activation:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner directly with account teams and field leadership to diagnose capability blockers and drive measurable increases in Monthly Active Users (MAU) across strategic enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Builder Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate a builder culture within the team to design and deploy custom enablement applications, tools, and prototypes (e.g., via Databricks Apps, Genie, or agentic frameworks) when standard curricula fall short.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive &amp;amp; Stakeholder Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct deep discovery sessions with enterprise technical leaders and C-suite executives, aligning strategic capability roadmaps with the customer&#39;s high-level AI transformation goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Operational Integrity:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the regional voice into global curriculum and certification teams to prioritize EMEA market needs and skill gaps, while maintaining strict operational rigor with training logistics teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Regional Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Undertake regional travel across EMEA to engage directly with strategic enterprise accounts on-site , lead high-stakes executive alignment sessions , and provide hands-on leadership to a geographically dispersed team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep foundational understanding of lakehouse architecture, data engineering/ETL pipelines, data governance, and generative AI/agentic workflows to earn immediate respect from customer data teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Builder Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A non-negotiable track record of personally designing, building, and deploying working prototypes, automation tools, or technical apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Facing Solutioning:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience in a solutions architect, customer success engineering, customer enablement, or advanced delivery role, with a proven ability to confidently navigate ambiguity and discover core user friction points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement Reinvention:&lt;/strong&gt; Passion for moving beyond legacy classroom-style or completion-centric learning models into just-in-time, contextual capability building embedded directly in user workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Business Insight:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to connect technical skill outcomes to core P&amp;amp;L levers, influence renewals/expansions, and collaborate effectively with sales on strategic account planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA Fluency &amp;amp; Mobility (Required)&lt;/strong&gt;: Lived experience operating across EMEA markets . Ability and willingness to travel to meet customers and support team members across different EMEA locations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership and Credibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience leading and managing technical or customer-facing engineering teams, with a proven ability to mentor talent, hold a high bar, and build a cohesive team identity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming&amp;nbsp;organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting&amp;nbsp;with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible&lt;br&gt;business impact.&lt;br&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work&amp;nbsp;with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Zurich office is&amp;nbsp;at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic&amp;nbsp;challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and&amp;nbsp;new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are looking for a Senior Data &amp;amp; AI Architect who combines business strategy and technology across Data and GenAI. You will design the operating model and the organization of the Data &amp;amp; GenAI CoE, define the target architecture, and steer data products from demand through to rollout.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Operating model and organization&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design the Data &amp;amp; AI operating model (centralized, federated, hub-and-spoke) following Data Mesh principles: roles, responsibilities, domain ownership and governance mechanisms.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Define the organization of the Data &amp;amp; GenAI CoE: scope, service catalogue, skills, sizing and engagement model with business domains.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design end-to-end processes for demand management, use case prioritization, funding and value tracking.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Architecture and technology choices&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Define the target data platform architecture on cloud (Azure, AWS, GCP) and Databricks, including GenAI components (RAG, agents, vector stores, LLMOps).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Run make-or-buy analyses and vendor selections: scouting, evaluation criteria, business case, TCO and final recommendation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Check that architecture, security and data governance choices are consistent with enterprise standards and with the operating model.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Data products: from demand to rollout&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Gather and formalize functional requirements with the business, translating them into data products with owners, consumers, SLAs and quality metrics.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design data products from both a functional angle (use cases, KPIs, impacted processes) and a technical one (data model, pipelines, interfaces, serving layer).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as design authority during implementation: review system integrator solutions and oversee quality, progress and risks of the rollout.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At least 4 years of professional experience in IT.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At least 2 years on projects focused on AI/GenAI, Data Mesh and functional requirements gathering.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Consulting experience, ideally in strategy consulting, combined with experience at a system integrator or delivery firm.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience designing operating models, Data/AI organizations or CoEs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with make-or-buy analyses, vendor selection or target architecture definition.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Technical and functional skills:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You will not be expected to write code, but you need to know the technologies well enough to assess them, challenge vendors and spot a flawed setup.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Data Mesh and governance: domain ownership, data products, federated governance, data contracts, catalogues and lineage (e.g. Unity Catalog, OpenMetadata, Collibra).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cloud: data and AI PaaS services on at least one of Azure, AWS and GCP; security, networking and FinOps principles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Databricks: Lakehouse, Delta Lake, Unity Catalog, Workflows; ability to assess design and cost.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;GenAI: RAG and agentic architectures, LLMOps, model evaluation, platforms such as Azure AI Foundry, Vertex AI and Bedrock.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Operating model: Data/AI organization, CoE, roles (data owner, data steward, product owner), demand and portfolio processes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Requirements and delivery: requirements gathering, user stories, process modelling, agile methods, programme governance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Business: business cases, TCO, value tracking, and the ability to translate technical choices into economic impact.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;German not strictly required.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with clients in pharma sector.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cloud or Databricks certifications (e.g. Azure Solutions Architect, Databricks Data Engineer or Solutions Architect).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience in tech due diligence or post-merger transformation projects.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior technical background as an engineer or developer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A role bridging strategy and technology, with direct impact on client decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;International projects on Data Mesh, data platforms and GenAI.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Close collaboration with the Project Lead and a growth path towards programme leadership roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Location and working model: (Hybrid) Zurich or Lausanne.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly competitive compensation package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don’t worry if you don’t meet all the criteria! We value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else. We’d love to hear from you and learn more about your passion for driving the AI revolution.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

